# Capacity loss as an independent variable. stock.env measures a REAL cold start.
#
# It reproduces the capacity loss exactly: a stalled pod is out of Envoy's endpoint
# list for the same reason a downloading one is. It does NOT reproduce a cold pod
# absorbing its share at Ready, because vLLM still warms fully before the readiness
# probe passes.
#
# Ceiling is the readinessProbe budget (900s) minus model load, so stay under ~700.
STARTUP_DELAY_SECONDS=${STARTUP_DELAY_SECONDS:-240}
